{"code":"PK22","wikidata":"Q123537782","wikipedia":{"en":"Ram Inthra Kor Mor 6 MRT station","th":"สถานีรามอินทรา กม.6"},"summary":{"en":"Ram Inthra Kor Mor 6 station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Pink Line. The station is located on Ram Inthra Road, near Nuan Chan Intersection in Khan Na Yao district, Bangkok. The station has four exits and is named after its location, which is approximately 6 kilometers from the origin of Ram Inthra Road.","th":"สถานีรามอินทรา กม.6 เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีชมพู โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนรามอินทราในพื้นที่คาบเกี่ยวระหว่างเขตคันนายาวกับเขตบึงกุ่ม กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"2023-11-21","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/MRT_Pink_Line_Ram_Inthra_Kor_Mor_6_Station_20231203-1.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Ram_Inthra_Kor_Mor_6_Station_20231203-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Ram_Inthra_Kor_Mor_6_Station_20231203-1.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/MRT_Pink_Line_Ram_Inthra_Kor_Mor_6_Station_20231203-2.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Ram_Inthra_Kor_Mor_6_Station_20231203-2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Ram_Inthra_Kor_Mor_6_Station_20231203-2.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/MRT_Pink_Line_Ram_Inthra_Kor_Mor_6_Station_20231203-3.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Ram_Inthra_Kor_Mor_6_Station_20231203-3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Ram_Inthra_Kor_Mor_6_Station_20231203-3.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/MRT_Pink_Line_Ram_Inthra_Kor_M